{"text":"<p><span>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gwLaf5-qefU</span></p><p><br /></p><p>### 75-1. Kilesaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-47-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-47a-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26909.487994990464\">7:28:29</span> 1. Nokilesaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nokileso kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-47a-1</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26921.334524148773\">7:28:41</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26926.630258226975\">7:28:46</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26931.457401068663\">7:28:51</span> 2. Kilesaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kileso akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-47a-2</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26944.209235944687\">7:29:04</span> Nokilesaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nokileso akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26954.318131146865\">7:29:14</span> Kilesaṃ akusalañca nokilesaṃ akusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca kileso akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26965.063735886513\">7:29:25</span> 3. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe nava (sabbattha nava), avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-47a-3</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26971.512214692917\">7:29:31</span> 4. Kilesaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kileso akusalo dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā – vicikicchaṃ paṭicca vicikicchāsahagato moho, uddhaccaṃ paṭicca uddhaccasahagato moho (1). ^7-47a-4</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"26989.338732769687\">7:29:49</span> Nokilesaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kileso akusalo dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā – vicikicchāsahagate uddhaccasahagate khandhe paṭicca vicikicchāsahagato uddhaccasahagato moho. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27008.394641866485\">7:30:08</span> Kilesaṃ akusalañca nokilesaṃ akusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca kileso akusalo dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā – vicikicchāsahagate khandhe ca vicikicchañca paṭicca vicikicchāsahagato moho, uddhaccasahagate khandhe ca uddhaccañca paṭicca uddhaccasahagato moho. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27033.190235163554\">7:30:33</span> 5. Nahetuyā tīṇi, naadhipatiyā nava, napurejāte nava, napacchājāte nava, naāsevane nava, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke nava, navippayutte nava (saṃkhittaṃ, sahajātavārādi vitthāretabbo). ^7-47a-5</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27052.342792230313\">7:30:52</span> 6. Kileso akusalo dhammo kilesassa akusalassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-47a-6</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27062.32983415354\">7:31:02</span> 7. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava (majjhe tīṇi sahajātādhipati), anantare nava, samanantare nava…pe… upanissaye nava, āsevane nava, kamme tīṇi, āhāre tīṇi, indriye tīṇi, jhāne tīṇi, magge nava, sampayutte nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-47a-7</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27086.559358006674\">7:31:26</span> Nokilesaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nokileso abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27095.58601673631\">7:31:35</span> 8. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-47a-8</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27101.186181933244\">7:31:41</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 76-1. Saṃkilesikaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-47b-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-47c-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27106.324642257016\">7:31:46</span> 9. Saṃkilesikaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saṃkilesiko kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-47c-9</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27118.71437899666\">7:31:58</span> Asaṃkilesikaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca asaṃkilesiko kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27127.785937273704\">7:32:07</span> 10. Hetuyā dve, ārammaṇe dve…pe… avigate dve (saṃkhittaṃ. Lokiyadukakusalasadisaṃ. Sahajātavārampi…pe… pañhāvārampi vitthāretabbaṃ). ^7-47c-10</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27140.402191966623\">7:32:20</span> 11. Saṃkilesikaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saṃkilesiko akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-47c-11</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27152.49190311349\">7:32:32</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27157.707143786378\">7:32:37</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27162.732549866487\">7:32:42</span> 12. Saṃkilesikaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saṃkilesiko abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-47c-12</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27172.492644619484\">7:32:52</span> Asaṃkilesikaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca asaṃkilesiko abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27187.922327070097\">7:33:07</span> Saṃkilesikaṃ abyākatañca asaṃkilesikaṃ abyākatañca dhammaṃ paṭicca saṃkilesiko abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27200.065029113488\">7:33:20</span> 13. Hetuyā pañca, ārammaṇe dve…pe… avigate pañca (saṃkhittaṃ. Lokiyadukaabyākatasadisaṃ. Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha vitthāretabbaṃ). ^7-47c-13</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 77-1. Saṃkiliṭṭhaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-47d-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-47e-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27214.235583247002\">7:33:34</span> 14. Asaṃkiliṭṭhaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca asaṃkiliṭṭho kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-47e-14</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27226.048494866485\">7:33:46</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27231.71741009012\">7:33:51</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27236.601784193597\">7:33:56</span> 15. Saṃkiliṭṭhaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saṃkiliṭṭho akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-47e-15</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27245.173011742983\">7:34:05</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27250.185961\">7:34:10</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27255.8860208765\">7:34:15</span> 16. Asaṃkiliṭṭhaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca asaṃkiliṭṭho abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-47e-16</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27265.349268043392\">7:34:25</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27270.92806084312\">7:34:30</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 78-1. Kilesasampayuttaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-47f-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-47g-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27276.0665050968\">7:34:36</span> 17. Kilesavippayuttaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kilesavippayutto kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-47g-17</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27285.111356863148\">7:34:45</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27289.957610180245\">7:34:49</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27295.189640769688\">7:34:55</span> 18. Kilesasampayuttaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kilesasampayutto akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-47g-18</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27305.106200993323\">7:35:05</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27310.454955026704\">7:35:10</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27315.927206016688\">7:35:15</span> 19. Kilesavippayuttaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kilesavippayutto abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-47g-19</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27326.453621752997\">7:35:26</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27332.581858806403\">7:35:32</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 79-1. Saṃkilesasaṃkilesikaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-47h-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-47i-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27337.616867\">7:35:37</span> 20. Saṃkilesikañceva no ca kilesaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saṃkilesiko ceva no ca kileso kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-47i-20</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27349.570896816418\">7:35:49</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27355.207960616146\">7:35:55</span> (Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27360.627377163557\">7:36:00</span> 21. Kilesañceva saṃkilesikañca akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kileso ceva saṃkilesiko ca akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-47i-21</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27373.302163090124\">7:36:13</span> Saṃkilesikañceva no ca kilesaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saṃkilesiko ceva no ca kileso akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27387.592697969958\">7:36:27</span> Kilesañceva saṃkilesikaṃ akusalañca saṃkilesikañceva no ca kilesaṃ akusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca kileso ceva saṃkilesiko ca akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27405.04204474966\">7:36:45</span> 22. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ, kilesadukaakusalasadisaṃ. Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha vitthāretabbaṃ). ^7-47i-22</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27418.014994916553\">7:36:58</span> 23. Saṃkilesikañceva no ca kilesaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saṃkilesiko ceva no ca kileso abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-47i-23</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27435.27941923031\">7:37:15</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27440.513294869823\">7:37:20</span> (Sahajātavārepi …pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 80-1. Kilesasaṃkiliṭṭhaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-47j-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-47k-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27445.544639823092\">7:37:25</span> 24. Kilesañceva saṃkiliṭṭhañca akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kileso ceva saṃkiliṭṭho ca akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-47k-24</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27457.945932893188\">7:37:37</span> Saṃkiliṭṭhañceva no ca kilesaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saṃkiliṭṭho ceva no ca kileso akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27470.57867912684\">7:37:50</span> Kilesañceva saṃkiliṭṭhaṃ akusalañca saṃkiliṭṭhañceva no ca kilesaṃ akusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca kileso ceva saṃkiliṭṭho ca akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27486.99125428372\">7:38:06</span> 25. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ. Kilesadukaakusalasadisaṃ. Sahajātavārampi…pe… pañhāvārampi sabbattha vitthāretabbaṃ). ^7-47k-25</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 81-1. Kilesakilesasampayuttaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-47l-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-47m-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27500.79042984646\">7:38:20</span> 26. Kilesañceva kilesasampayuttañca akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kileso ceva kilesasampayutto ca akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-47m-26</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27517.524568909877\">7:38:37</span> Kilesasampayuttañceva no ca kilesaṃ akusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kilesasampayutto ceva no ca kileso akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27531.93578573297\">7:38:51</span> Kilesañceva kilesasampayuttaṃ akusalañca kilesasampayuttañceva no ca kilesaṃ akusalañca dhammaṃ paṭicca kileso ceva kilesasampayutto ca akusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27550.14963926369\">7:39:10</span> 27. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ. Kilesadukaakusalasadisaṃ. Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha vitthāretabbaṃ). ^7-47m-27</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 82-1. Kilesavippayuttasaṃkilesikaduka-kusalattikaṃ ^7-47n-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-47o-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27564.835593240325\">7:39:24</span> 28. Kilesavippayuttaṃ saṃkilesikaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kilesavippayutto saṃkilesiko kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-47o-28</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27581.06522578304\">7:39:41</span> Kilesavippayuttaṃ asaṃkilesikaṃ kusalaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kilesavippayutto asaṃkilesiko kusalo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27594.093293006677\">7:39:54</span> 29. Hetuyā dve, ārammaṇe dve…pe… avigate dve (saṃkhittaṃ. Lokiyadukakusalasadisaṃ. Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi vitthāretabbaṃ). ^7-47o-29</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27608.27613095661\">7:40:08</span> 30. Kilesavippayuttaṃ saṃkilesikaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kilesavippayutto saṃkilesiko abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-47o-30</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27625.44356085647\">7:40:25</span> Kilesavippayuttaṃ asaṃkilesikaṃ abyākataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kilesavippayutto asaṃkilesiko abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27641.705513066758\">7:40:41</span> Kilesavippayuttaṃ saṃkilesikaṃ abyākatañca kilesavippayuttaṃ asaṃkilesikaṃ abyākatañca dhammaṃ paṭicca kilesavippayutto saṃkilesiko abyākato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"27663.898233120162\">7:41:03</span> 31. Hetuyā pañca, ārammaṇe dve…pe… āsevane ekaṃ…pe… avigate pañca (saṃkhittaṃ. Lokiyadukaabyākatasadisaṃ. Sahajātavārepi…pe… pañhāvārepi sabbattha vitthāretabbaṃ). ^7-47o-31</p><p><br /></p><p>Kilesagocchakakusalattikaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p></p>","media-time":27685.912499}